{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:56.818910Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-06c97f70e1341ea0","text":"CI and test speed was a huge blocker; the suite was huge, bloated and unoptimized","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:56.907259Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-daf01614d8987f38","text":"Much of the test suite enforced what should have been compile-time or type-level facts","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:57.001140Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-dc4ad852317276d8","text":"The full suite ran on unrelated changes; a small data change forced a full rebuild and recheck","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:57.095639Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-c06bdc1c76dce29d","text":"App code and trip data were not separated (not a general travel app taking data files)","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:57.186818Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-1f95e2ec3112fdb0","text":"Nobody knew which code affected which features, so everything was rechecked and CI ran out","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:57.281092Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-fa46a1f6e53d0bc1","text":"Development was serial: the current feature blocked unrelated work (worst with #72)","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:57.378693Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-03ba5fe6804c9c56","text":"Criticality was haphazard and miscalibrated in both directions, with no triage across the spec","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:57.471287Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-196b9c6879e9c573","text":"Tracking implemented versus unimplemented features was a mess","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:57.564312Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-4b3437bd67d3d494","text":"Worktrees did not share a compiler cache or build directory","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1 1","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:57.654536Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-33147672053375f3","text":"Simulators were shared instead of one per agent or test group","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1 2","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:57.748579Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-f0b2bda4e03e656f","text":"Flaky tests were retried and forgotten instead of flagged and fixed","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1 3","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:57.842021Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-aed7833c26fa8471","text":"The UI check used a browser for facts that need no layout, and for untouched screens","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1 4","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:57.932747Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-2ca85f8d31bbf180","text":"Data was keyed by leg numbers, not stable ids; generated files were large and coarse","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1 5","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:58.027811Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-5af7039d3b850d22","text":"Most time was spent waiting for CI and tests","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.1 7","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:58.119689Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-a7c461b0b4f73479","text":"The main session relayed every hand-off while agents sat idle","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.2","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:58.212574Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-dea572681f3c0316","text":"No single source of truth: status files, a handoff note and the main session's context","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.2","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:58.306429Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-1e9ecbf820e559d9","text":"Agents collided on simulators, Chrome, search quota and data files","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.2","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
{"at":"2026-10-25T03:30:58.402602Z","kind":"ConcernIdentified","concern":"concern-c9db8b2d338df233","text":"Ownership of work was unclear","source":"docs/basho-postmortem.md §3.2","tags":["acceptance-candidate"]}
